    description: "Server stores bcrypt hashes for both real and duress passwords. After WebAuthn success, verify password. Real password → normal session. Duress password → session tagged server-side as duress (indistinguishable token). Rate limiting per WebAuthn credential with exponential backoff. Configurable max failures before credential lockout. See docs/adr/0019-remote-access-transport.md §Authentication factor 3-4."  # e243
